+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: bounded-modulus recognition scans q<10000 in O(B*n+n log n) "
+        "exact operations and, at the shipping preset n=72, performs 2,159,568 "
+        "modular reductions (measured by selftest), whereas recognizing the "
